1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:03,850
Alia, c'est quand, ton anniversaire ?
Alia, when is your birthday?

2
00:00:04,150 --> 00:00:07,966
Mon anniversaire, c'est le quinze décembre.
My birthday is on December fifteenth.

3
00:00:08,266 --> 00:00:12,154
C'est bientôt ! Tu fais une fête ?
That's soon! Are you having a party?

4
00:00:12,454 --> 00:00:15,814
Oui, chez moi, avec un gâteau !
Yes, at my place, with a cake!

5
00:00:16,114 --> 00:00:20,122
Super ! J'apporte un cadeau !
Great! I'll bring a gift!

6
00:00:20,422 --> 00:00:24,646
Oh, merci ! Tu es gentil !
Oh, thanks! You're kind!

7
00:00:24,946 --> 00:00:27,970
Joyeux anniversaire en avance !
Happy birthday in advance!

8
00:00:28,270 --> 00:00:32,374
Merci, Nino ! À bientôt !
Thanks, Nino! See you soon!

